es. Rinse them well.\n# Cover the kidneys with cold water, and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]]. Drain the water, and rinse the kidneys again.\n# Cover kidneys with cold water again, and boil for half an hour.\n# Melt the butter in a soup pot. Add parsley root and onion, and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] until onions are translucent.\n# Add sliced potatoes to pot, and cover with filtered broth. Cook for 30 minutes.\n# 10 minutes before the end of cooking, add the cucumbers, chopped sorrel, and salt.\n# Just before serving, add kidneys, sour cream, and parsley or dill.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using barley]]\n[[Category:Russian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber pickles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dill]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Rassolnik (Russian Barley and Kidney Soup)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"500 g beef kidneys","sourceText":"500 g beef kidneys","amountText":"500 g beef kidneys","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tbsp butter","sourceText":"2 tbsp butter","amountText":"2 tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 parsley roots, sliced in strips","sourceText":"2 parsley roots, sliced in strips","amountText":"2 parsley roots, sliced in strips","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 onion, sliced in strips","sourceText":"1 onion, sliced in strips","amountText":"1 onion, sliced in strips","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"4 potatoes, sliced","sourceText":"4 potatoes, sliced","amountText":"4 potatoes, sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 pickled cucumbers","sourceText":"2 pickled cucumbers","amountText":"2 pickled cucumbers","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBindin